{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 33,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Walk in Love"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore be imitators of God as dear children. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And walk in love, as Christ also has loved us and given Himself for us, an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweet-smelling aroma."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But fornication and all uncleanness or covetousness, let it not even be named among you, as is fitting for saints; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "neither filthiness, nor foolish talking, nor coarse jesting, which are not fitting, but rather giving of thanks. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU know this"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "this you know, that no fornicator, unclean person, nor covetous man, who is an idolater, has any inheritance in the kingdom of Christ and God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one deceive you with empty words, for because of these things the wrath of God comes upon the sons of disobedience. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore do not be partakers with them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Walk in Light"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you were once darkness, but now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " light in the Lord. Walk as children of light "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(for the fruit of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU light"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Spirit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in all goodness, righteousness, and truth), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "finding out what is acceptable to the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And have no fellowship with the unfruitful works of darkness, but rather "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "reprove"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "expose "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For it is shameful even to speak of those things which are done by them in secret. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But all things that are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "reproved"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "exposed are made manifest by the light, for whatever makes manifest is light. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore He says:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Awake, you who sleep,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Arise from the dead,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Christ will give you light.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Walk in Wisdom"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "See then that you walk "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "carefully"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "circumspectly, not as fools but as wise, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "redeeming the time, because the days are evil."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore do not be unwise, but understand what the will of the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And do not be drunk with wine, in which is dissipation; but be filled with the Spirit, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "speaking to one another in psalms and hymns and spiritual songs, singing and making melody in your heart to the Lord, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "giving thanks always for all things to God the Father in the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "submitting to one another in the fear of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Marriage—Christ and the Church"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Wives, submit to your own husbands, as to the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the husband is head of the wife, as also Christ is head of the church; and He is the Savior of the body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, just as the church is subject to Christ, so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "let"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the wives "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to their own husbands in everything."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Husbands, love your wives, just as Christ also loved the church and gave Himself for her, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that He might "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set it apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctify and cleanse her with the washing of water by the word, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that He might present her to Himself a glorious church, not having spot or wrinkle or any such thing, but that she should be holy and without blemish. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So husbands ought to love their own wives as their own bodies; he who loves his wife loves himself. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For no one ever hated his own flesh, but nourishes and cherishes it, just as the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the church. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we are members of His body, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 30."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "of His flesh and of His bones. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“For this reason a man shall leave his father and mother and be joined to his wife, and the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "two shall become one flesh.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This is a great mystery, but I speak concerning Christ and the church. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless let each one of you in particular so love his own wife as himself, and let the wife "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "see"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that she respects "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "her"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " husband."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}